{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Let it consume\u00a0</strong>is a short incremental game about running a dark cult and satisfying an ancient, hungry presence.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Grow your cult</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create imps to serve your will, each one filled with faith, guilt, and other resources to extract.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4161970/extras/8427e12d3522e9f595229483665d3f16.poster.avif?t=1767619461\" width=960 height=396 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4161970/extras/8427e12d3522e9f595229483665d3f16.webm?t=1767619461\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4161970/extras/8427e12d3522e9f595229483665d3f16.mp4?t=1767619461\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Perform dark rituals</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sacrifice your followers to strengthen your idol, unlock new upgrades, and uncover forbidden powers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4161970/extras/fbeff651f41ad149c89f3b70c094af27.poster.avif?t=1767619461\" width=960 height=396 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4161970/extras/fbeff651f41ad149c89f3b70c094af27.webm?t=1767619461\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4161970/extras/fbeff651f41ad149c89f3b70c094af27.mp4?t=1767619461\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gain faith, guilt and souls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balance devotion, resources, and sacrifice to keep your cult thriving as your idol\u2019s appetite grows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4161970/extras/105cf8c2c9379ba8f58bcb580a06433f.poster.avif?t=1767619461\" width=960 height=396 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4161970/extras/105cf8c2c9379ba8f58bcb580a06433f.webm?t=1767619461\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4161970/extras/105cf8c2c9379ba8f58bcb580a06433f.mp4?t=1767619461\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlock unique powers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch your rituals become faster, your power stronger, and your idol ever more demanding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4161970/extras/b984efa065f0114b778915d8a925801f.poster.avif?t=1767619461\" width=960 height=396 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4161970/extras/b984efa065f0114b778915d8a925801f.webm?t=1767619461\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4161970/extras/b984efa065f0114b778915d8a925801f.mp4?t=1767619461\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enjoy:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Active incremental gameplay focused on sacrifice and resource management</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expanding upgrade tree of dark abilities and rituals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short but unique incremental experience (~3 hours to complete)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric soundscape and ambient music</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple controls, perfect for mouse-only play</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4161970?t=1767619461","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4161970?t=1767619461","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4161970/2d358ce8ee1df174a7b86c71641169f8ec078ade/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767619461","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4161970/2d358ce8ee1df174a7b86c71641169f8ec078ade/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767619461","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4256620,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Let it consume\u00a0</strong>is a short incremental game about running a dark cult and satisfying an ancient, hungry presence.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Grow your cult</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create imps to serve your will, each one filled with faith, guilt, and other resources to extract.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4161970/extras/8427e12d3522e9f595229483665d3f16.poster.avif?t=1767619461\" width=960 height=396 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4161970/extras/8427e12d3522e9f595229483665d3f16.webm?t=1767619461\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4161970/extras/8427e12d3522e9f595229483665d3f16.mp4?t=1767619461\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Perform dark rituals</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sacrifice your followers to strengthen your idol, unlock new upgrades, and uncover forbidden powers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=